<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>It's a easy to use script for Russinan fishing 4 .
How to use: Just set the hook into a fish and launch the script. 
The script drags the fish  so you don't need to do it.
You do not need to use any specific resolution to use the script.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 224 1
RightDown 1
Delay 64
RightUp 1
KeyUp 224 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 225 1
LeftDown 1
Delay 26000 min
RightDown 1
GoWhile 7 5</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Russian Fishing 4</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>